          <div><b>Detection with recovery verification.</b> Finding a failure is half the job; Failora checks that retries and fallbacks recover.</div>
          <div><b>Evidence-based findings.</b> Each issue links to the request, file or line behind it.</div>
          <div><b>Repeatable regression tests.</b> A failure becomes a test that runs on every change.</div>
